lass=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.30.9287<br/>December 02, 2019<br/>Winter Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See Also: Outfits, Outfiter <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-images\" style=\"font-size:small;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Images\">Images</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Outfit</th>\n<th>Addon 1</th>\n<th>Addon 2</th>\n<th>Addons 1+2\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Male\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Male_f7b3ac.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Male_Addon_1_15db13.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Male_Addon_2_e87f93.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Male_Addon_3_99c659.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Female\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Female_b85c1d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Female_Addon_1_534bf7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Female_Addon_2_cbfcda.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Falconer Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Falconer_Female_Addon_3_8394c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The base Falconer Outfit is obtained by trading <b>100,000</b> <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hunting Task Points\"><img alt=\"Hunting Task Points\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunting_Task_Points_c5ff65.png\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Hunting Task Points (HTP) within the <a href=\"#/wiki/Task%20Board\">Hunting Task Shop</a>. Additionally, each addon can be obtained by trading <b>35,000</b> <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hunting Task Points\"><img alt=\"Hunting Task Points\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunting_Task_Points_c5ff65.png\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span>. Therefore, the full outfits are only obtained after trading the total sum of <b>170,000</b> <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hunting Task Points\"><img alt=\"Hunting Task Points\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunting_Task_Points_c5ff65.png\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-outfit-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Previously, you used to obtain the complete Falconer Outfit by trading a total of <b>170,000</b> <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hunting Task Points\"><img alt=\"Hunting Task Points\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunting_Task_Points_c5ff65.png\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Hunting Task Points with <a href=\"#/wiki/Walter%20Jaeger\">Walter Jaeger</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Outfits\">Related Outfits</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Special_Outfits\">Special Outfits</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Aerial Disciple Outfits</li><li>Arbalester Outfits</li><li>Arena Champion Outfits</li><li>Armoured Archer Outfits</li><li>Bat Knight Outfits</li><li>Beastmaster Outfits</li><li>Beekeeper Outfits</li><li>Blade Dancer Outfits</li><li>Breezy Garb Outfits</li><li>Celestial Avenger Outfits</li><li>Ceremonial Garb Outfits</li><li>Champion Outfits</li><li>Chaos Acolyte Outfits</li><li>Conjurer Outfits</li><li>Darklight Evoker Outfits</li><li>Death Herald Outfits</li><li>Doom Knight Outfits</li><li>Dragon Knight Outfits</li><li>Entrepreneur Outfits</li><li>Evoker Outfits</li><li>Fencer Outfits</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feral%20Trapper%20Outfits\">Feral Trapper Outfits</a></li><li>Field Surgeon Outfits</li><li>Flamefury Mage Outfits</li><li>Forest Warden Outfits</li><li>Frost Tracer Outfits</li><li>Ghost Blade Outfits</li><li>Grove Keeper Outfits</li><li>Guidon Bearer Outfits</li><li>Herbalist Outfits</li><li>Herder Outfits</li><li>Jersey Outfits</li><li>Jouster Outfits</li><li>Lion of War Outfits</li><li>Lupine Warden Outfits</li><li>Martial Artist Outfits</li><li>Mercenary Outfits</li><li>Merry Garb Outfits</li><li>Moon Guardian Outfits</li><li>Moth Cape Outfits</li><li>Necromancer Outfits</li><li>Nordic Chieftain Outfits</li><li>Owl Keeper Outfits</li><li>Pharaoh Outfits</li><li>Philosopher Outfits</li><li>Phoenix Evoker Outfits</li><li>Pumpkin Mummy Outfits</li><li>Puppeteer Outfits</li><li>Ranger Outfits</li><li>Recruiter Outfits</li><li>Retro Citizen Outfits</li><li>Retro Hunter Outfits</li><li>Retro Knight Outfits</li><li>Retro Mage Outfits</li><li>Retro Nobleman Outfits</li><li>Retro Summoner Outfits</li><li>Retro Warrior Outfits</li><li>Royal Pumpkin Outfits</li><li>Rune Master Outfits</li><li>Sea Dog Outfits</li><li>Seaweaver Outfits</li><li>Shadowlotus Disciple Outfits</li><li>Siege Master Outfits</li><li>Sinister Archer Outfits</li><li>Spirit Caller Outfits</li><li>Sun Priest Outfits</li><li>Trailblazer Outfits</li><li>Trophy Hunter Outfits</li><li>Vampire Noble Outfits</li><li>Veteran Paladin Outfits</li><li>Void Master Outfits</li><li>Winged Druid Outfits</li><li>Winter Warden Outfits</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["falconer-outfits-quest"]}